# The shipped shell scripts must stay LF in the WORKING TREE, not only in the blob.
# `factory init` copies them out of the working tree, so on a machine with
# core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout would hand every install a CRLF shell script --
# which dies on Linux as `bad interpreter: ^M`, a message that reads as a missing file.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text
*.json text
*.yaml text
